{"bugReports":[],"mods":[{"id":"m1790394292606608","name":"Camerapture","desc":"Camerapture是一个相机/图片模组。它添加了相机，可以拍摄玩家在游戏中看到的景象。\n玩家还可以使用相机上传自定义图片，这些图片可以与其他玩家分享，并挂在墙上供所有人查看。","createdAt":1790394292606},{"id":"m1790394004442965","name":"传送石碑","desc":"本模组添加了一个在激活后可将玩家传送至其所在位置的传送石碑和一些实用性的传送道具，免去了玩家长途跋涉的烦恼。","createdAt":1790394004442},{"id":"m1790394082582392","name":"搬运","desc":"你是否疑惑强壮的史蒂夫能够携带以吨为计的物品翻山越岭，却无法空手搬运一个装着物品的箱子?的确挺“不科学”或许你想说潜影盒和末影箱就足以用于便携存储了，但是CarryOn带来的不仅仅如此。","createdAt":1790394082582},{"id":"m1790394042327630","name":"投影打印机","desc":"这是一个投影模组的拓展，它允许玩家通过在投影中放置正确的方块来更快地建造大型结构。","createdAt":1790394042327}],"votes":[{"modId":"m1790394292606608","voterId":"vmu3p47yh9cyg2vjs","votedAt":1790394602028},{"modId":"m1790394004442965","voterId":"vmuhuto1oza1rk7wz","votedAt":1790394783669},{"modId":"m1790394004442965","voterId":"vmu3vgk6xr3vgw014","votedAt":1790395000999},{"modId":"m1790394042327630","voterId":"vmu3otih7qnb8f3zj","votedAt":1790395019073},{"modId":"m1790394292606608","voterId":"vmughrpf410ayerr4","votedAt":1790395073807},{"modId":"m1790394004442965","voterId":"vmuhv4uaarfvvzsmn","votedAt":1790395359284},{"modId":"m1790394004442965","voterId":"vmu2rfsvabwqtcz9w","votedAt":1790395394206},{"modId":"m1790394292606608","voterId":"vmuhv00pinv2obfor","votedAt":1790395735162},{"modId":"m1790394004442965","voterId":"vmu6qx9pkm4l4ggun","votedAt":1790396080200},{"modId":"m1790394292606608","voterId":"vmuhvl9uy0f6yqpv1","votedAt":1790396132196},{"modId":"m1790394082582392","voterId":"vmuhw1apz3boxh4hq","votedAt":1790396818835},{"modId":"m1790394292606608","voterId":"vmuhw5s0zjn2ynozc","votedAt":1790397024129},{"modId":"m1790394082582392","voterId":"vmuhwslowwy2tilqz","votedAt":1790398088991},{"modId":"m1790394042327630","voterId":"vmuhwt6ty6x9fzdr4","votedAt":1790398116656},{"modId":"m1790394082582392","voterId":"vmuhwtefbx0c6bwoj","votedAt":1790398128526},{"modId":"m1790394082582392","voterId":"vmuhwtn66ofwvqupp","votedAt":1790398136848},{"modId":"m1790394082582392",